sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as Envoy Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant BBR as Body Based Router<br/>9004/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant EPP as Endpoint Picker<br/>9002/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant ModelServer as Model Server Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant TrainSrv as Training Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (sidecar)
    participant PredSrv as Prediction Server<br/>8001/TCP HTTP (sidecar)
    participant OTel as OTel Collector<br/>4317/TCP gRPC

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Flow 1: Inference Request with Body-Based Routing

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+
    Gateway->>BBR: ext-proc RequestHeaders + RequestBody<br/>gRPC/9004, TLS
    BBR->>BBR: Parse JSON body, extract model name
    BBR-->>Gateway: HeaderMutation: X-Gateway-Model-Name<br/>gRPC response
    Gateway->>Gateway: HTTPRoute matching on<br/>X-Gateway-Model-Name header

    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc RequestHeaders<br/>gRPC/9002, TLS (optional)
    EPP->>EPP: Run scheduling pipeline:<br/>Filter → Score → Pick

    Note over EPP,ModelServer: EPP selects optimal endpoint based on<br/>KV-cache utilization, queue depth,<br/>running requests, LoRA availability

    EPP-->>Gateway: HeaderMutation: backend endpoint address<br/>gRPC response
    Gateway->>ModelServer: Forward request to selected pod<br/>HTTP/8000
    ModelServer-->>Gateway: Inference response (streaming or unary)
    Gateway->>EPP: ext-proc ResponseHeaders/ResponseBody<br/>gRPC/9002
    EPP->>EPP: Record response metrics<br/>(latency, tokens, completion status)
    EPP-->>Gateway: Response processing complete
    Gateway-->>Client: Inference response<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over EPP,ModelServer: Flow 2: Background Metrics Scraping (every 50ms default)

    loop Every 50ms (configurable)
        EPP->>ModelServer: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/8000, InsecureSkipVerify default
        ModelServer-->>EPP: Prometheus metrics:<br/>queue_depth, kv_cache_usage,<br/>running_requests, lora_info
        EPP->>EPP: Update DataLayer AttributeMap<br/>via DataSource → Extractor pipeline
    end

    Note over EPP,K8sAPI: Flow 3: CRD & Pod Discovery (continuous watch)

    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, InferenceObjective,<br/>InferenceModelRewrite CRDs<br/>HTTPS/443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>EPP: CRD events (Added/Modified/Deleted)
    EPP->>K8sAPI: Watch Pods matching pool label selector<br/>HTTPS/443, ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>EPP: Pod events (endpoint discovery)

    Note over EPP,PredSrv: Flow 4: Latency Prediction Feedback Loop (optional)

    EPP->>TrainSrv: POST /add_training_data_bulk<br/>HTTP/8000 (localhost sidecar)<br/>Latency observations from completed requests
    TrainSrv->>TrainSrv: Train Bayesian Ridge /<br/>XGBoost / LightGBM models
    PredSrv->>TrainSrv: Fetch trained model coefficients<br/>GET /metrics, GET /model/download/info
    EPP->>PredSrv: POST /predict/bulk<br/>HTTP/8001 (localhost sidecar)<br/>TTFT/TPOT predictions for scheduling

    Note over EPP,OTel: Flow 5: Observability Export (optional)

    EPP->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC/4317, plaintext
    BBR->>OTel: OTLP traces<br/>gRPC/4317, plaintext
